Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现时他们就这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found them like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来看凯伦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to see Karen…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了地上的血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I saw the blood on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.83,0:01:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后闻到了气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I smelled them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人把他们拖到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody dragged them out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后放火焚烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set them on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了他们 然后放火焚烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed them and set them on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查清楚是谁干的 然后把他们交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find out who did this and you bring 'em to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听懂了吗 把他们交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? You bring 'em to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会查出是谁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out who…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要重复吗 - 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to say it again? - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的感受 我也经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're feeling. I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过我的样子 那很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw me there. It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯伦不该被烧死 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Karen didn't deserve this. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫不该被烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}David didn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁都不该 - 好了 哥们 别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody does. - All right, man, let's…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不查出是谁干的 我绝不离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I ain't going nowhere till I find out who did this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一边的 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the same side, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都失去过爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all lost someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你现在的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what you're going through right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you've got to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你给我退后 - 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to step the hell back! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会想要你这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't want you being like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:51.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤至少得一周才能痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be sprained at least a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是 这些伤口都无需缝针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news, none of these cuts need stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的几天不要打字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't plan on much typing the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的不是你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking about the hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚经历了可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just went through something terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些我们竭力阻止的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we've been working so hard to keep out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,终究还是发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it found its way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该发生的总会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早要开委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Council meeting tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知你一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了12名同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just lost 12 of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两名被无情杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more we killed in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,疫情恐怕难以控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be facing an outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅一天 我就闯了不少祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've done enough damage for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也失控过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've fallen off the wagon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.79,0:05:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是一回事吗 - 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what this is? - Pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当遇到问题 我不会唉声叹气\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it happened, I didn't stand around feeling bad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会担起责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护大家的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}People to keep safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 去清洗下伤口吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you cleaned up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定要缝上几针\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might even need a couple stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把他们安葬了再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until they're in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你至少得让赫谢尔或者斯蒂文斯医生看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should at least let Hershel or Dr. S. take a look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保没什么大碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure nothing's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把他们安葬了再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they're in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有事的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be okay, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看凯伦和大卫都已经被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Karen and David, they were already sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要感染的话 这会儿早就被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we were gonna get it, we'd have had it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没有固定的发病时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't happen on a timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是因人而异的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we could be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything could be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是跟行尸 跟活人正面交锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's walkers, if it's people,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有法子 可以拼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can do something. We can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但遇上这个 我只能掘坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with this, I'm just digging graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,得去找S医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to see Dr. S.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,S医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. S.?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. S.?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染扩散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒传播很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,D区幸免遇难的人中 萨沙和迦勒已经感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who survived the attack in cell block D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在其他人也出现了症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha, Caleb, and now others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当务之急 封锁A区\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first. Cell block A is isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,像之前萨沙和迦勒那样 将所有被感染的人隔离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep the sick people there like we tried with Karen and David.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那接下来又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell we gonna do about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让瑞克去调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask Rick to look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个时间表 记录每个人在何时何地做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to make a timeline… who's where when.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要怎样才能阻止疫情恶化呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what are we gonna do to stop this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,被感染了 就会恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get it, you have to go through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那这不就是等死吗 - 病毒本身不致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it just kills you? - The illness doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是症状要命 我们需要抗生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}The symptoms do. We need antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近的药店我们都去过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through every pharmacy nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没找到多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,西桃工学院的兽医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}That veterinary college at West Peachtree Tech,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.89,0:09:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没人想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's one place people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那里找药\N{\fnArial\fs30}may not have thought to raid for medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物的药 人也能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drugs for animals there are the same we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,距这里有50英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 50 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.39,0:09:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前觉得太冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too big a risk before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不管了 我带一组人出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't now. I'm gonna take a group out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best not waste any more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有接触过病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔接触了 你跟他在一辆车里的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl has. You get in a car with him…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经把虱子传给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already given me fleas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道东西放在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where everything's kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面的时候 每次都有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we're out there, it's always the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.27,0:09:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚得跑步逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later we run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就给你们画张地图吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can draw you a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该做一些其他的预防措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other precautions I feel we should take.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔这组人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no telling how long it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候回来说不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Daryl and his group return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该把最易被感染的人隔离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't it make sense for us to separate the most vulnerable?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用行政办公楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use the administration building.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有独立的办公室和房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separate office, separate room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是最易被感染的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is the most vulnerable?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very young.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the old?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me another go at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,管子被泥土堵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole line's mudded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那头又掉到池底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end is dragging the bottom again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得出去清理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to go out there and clear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,设好诱饵 从墓地穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set the bird, go out through the tombs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再从森林小路绕到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}swing around through the forest route.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在的水还够用 明天再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got enough for now. That's tomorrow's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 萨沙被隔离之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, five more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有五个人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have come down with it since Sasha went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人所剩无几\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a lot of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你我病了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you get sick? What if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要是在外面遇险回不来怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we get in trouble out there and don't come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把这水给需要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this up to the people who need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把必要的事做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get what we have to get done first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔还在为被隔离的事生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Carl pretty pissed about going into quarantine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是安全更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's better to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全总是更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always better to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该去哀悼一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should both pay our respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先解决这个问题 待会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take this up first. Meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于发生的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要查出来是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to find who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太了解大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know David much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人和他或者和凯伦有仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone have a problem with him or Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:11:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天都跟她在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with her all the time, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟所有人都相处得很好 大卫也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got along with everybody. Same with David.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时只有他们两个病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were the only two who were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这件事的人可能是想阻止病毒蔓延\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person who did it might have trying to stop this thing from spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今萨沙也病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Sasha has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不管是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whoever it was who did this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逃不了的 我们会找到他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not going anywhere. We'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天找 现在就找吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我没觉得你很紧张这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm not feeling the urgency.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看见你在泵水\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I see you doing is pumping water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我的感觉是\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, what I'm picking up is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 即便是谋杀也是可以被接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}murder is okay in this place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得先保命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to save lives first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得维持这个地方的运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to keep this place going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去操心那个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来操心正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll worry about what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想和群孩子关在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be locked away with a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你在那儿照看朱迪思和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you in there keeping an eye on Judith and everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保他们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making sure they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如有人生病 你得让我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anybody gets sick, you let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.01,0:13:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我发现时 他们已经变异了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they've already turned when I find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非必要 你不能开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't fire unless you absolutely need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道我有可能得开枪的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know I might need to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.39,0:14:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格伦 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn? - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 别进来 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't… don't come in. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的机油不够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch is about a quart low.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是把机油放在三号塔底了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still keep it in the bottom of tower three?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:14:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很开心你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处漂泊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不会再漂泊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not running off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以还是像以前那样 只剩我和你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's just gonna be me and you like in the old days?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还有鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是缺个人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, feels like we could use another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁没病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else isn't sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没问瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't ask Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想留下陪卡尔和小拽女\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to stay here with Carl and little ass-kicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保他们安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.91,0:15:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上这儿有许多事他可以做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus there's plenty of stuff he could do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还能找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who else we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我费了好大劲儿找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me damn near forever to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatcha doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人看着 以防奸人图谋不轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody needs to stand watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我也想找到元凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I want to find them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他们干的事射他们一箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a bolt in them for what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里被封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.09,0:16:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人进出的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no way anyone's getting in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多人不可能没人看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a whole bunch of people seeing 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙还在里面 我哪里都不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha's in there. I ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不带药回来 那在这里守着也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing guard ain't gonna do no good unless we come back with them meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在前门加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gassing up by the front gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变主意了就来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case you change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:50.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（平静的大海 练不出 优秀的水手）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这下面躲开你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down here away from y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们这些孩子应该离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you kids are supposed to stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在巡视走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been walking the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸让我照看大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad told me to look out for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should keep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在往出口走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're walking towards the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.78,0:17:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去牢房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the cell blocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,去林子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.74,0:17:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就是在偷偷溜走咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're sneaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要任何人替我操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need anyone worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想让别人告诉我能不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I damn sure don't want someone telling me I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许你独自去林子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just let you go out into the woods by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.93,0:17:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,允许我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:17:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须告诉我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to tell my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你找到他时我已经在外面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be out there by the time you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一定要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I have to come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 这只是过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, it's just allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮特 - 很快就会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeanette. - They come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮特 - 伍德伯里来的人都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeanette. - Ask anyone from Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeanette.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol…?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡说你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mica said you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让你好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.81,0:19:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去里面躺着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just go in there and lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我盖被子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you tuck me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我的朋友格伦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my friend Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我知道的最会盖被子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the best tucker I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会让你觉得温暖舒适 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll make sure that you feel toasty and warm, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你肯留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for being in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不是非得这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这对朱迪思意义重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means a lot you being in there with Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things okay out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.74,0:20:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get to be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家各司其职 爸爸总是这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got jobs to do. That's what Daddy always says.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔和米琼恩会找到药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl and Michonne will get the meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有瑞克要在他们回来前照顾大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Rick will help everyone till they get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.07,0:20:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll take care of Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要关注我们该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just focus on what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论发生什么 我们都能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, we'll deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸什么时候把枪还你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did your dad give it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那一切发生后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过去几个月成长了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've grown a lot these last few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.61,0:21:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道要担起责任了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a responsibility about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你冷静一段时间看来很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's done you good to step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能总那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be like that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己在这里也没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have been fine on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.89,0:21:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's peaceful out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去这几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}These last couple days,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这墙外说不定比里面更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might be safer outside those walls than in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's wrap this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.09,0:23:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才这里真是平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不会总那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be like that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.17,0:23:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有看起来那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not as bad as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.77,0:23:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.93,0:23:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的样子肯定很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be a sight to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:23:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听说了凯伦的事 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard about Karen… - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.11,0:23:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别想这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.47,0:24:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想努力康复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.95,0:24:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想积极的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.82,0:24:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐观一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive vibes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔带了一队人出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl's got a group going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去找药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔知道个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace Hershel knew about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.09,0:24:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个兽医学院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That veterinary college?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.21,0:24:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那太远了 - 但他们很有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's far. - But they feel sure about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定明天就有药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we could have medicine as early as tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.65,0:24:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.23,0:24:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰 - 休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ty. - Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.09,0:24:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.87,0:24:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything look all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.01,0:24:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎克把这车保养得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zack kept this thing running pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.04,0:24:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是扎克的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Zack's car?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们速度最快的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fastest one we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.44,0:25:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.78,0:25:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的希望我陪你去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want me coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这词怎么念\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that word?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.31,0:25:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎那米韦（一种抗流感药）\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Zanamivir".
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.05,0:25:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.29,0:25:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 多一个人坐得下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up? - Still got room for one more?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to get my gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.75,0:25:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.34,0:26:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我没看到你在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I didn't see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.19,0:26:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.04,0:26:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.95,0:26:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟达里尔出去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going on the run with Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.69,0:26:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was wondering…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有很多人都身处困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know there's a lot of people in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.80,0:26:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.33,0:26:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just I know how you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.07,0:26:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.75,0:26:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.19,0:26:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你能不能帮我照顾萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering if you could look in on Sasha for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.24,0:26:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你照顾她 我就放心些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would make me feel better knowing you were looking in on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.24,0:26:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不行的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.34,0:26:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.85,0:26:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.33,0:26:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.87,0:26:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦的事 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what happened to Karen, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.63,0:27:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不在隔离区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you in quarantine?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.67,0:27:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里对大家都没好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no good to anyone in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.73,0:27:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.23,0:27:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 亲爱的 那里有很多人饱受煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, dear, there are people in there suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.78,0:27:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮他们退烧 维持性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can bring their fever down and keep them stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.04,0:27:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔去拿抗生素了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl's getting the antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.69,0:27:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有的人根本撑不过12小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of these people won't last 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.06,0:28:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.27,0:28:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 格伦就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, Glenn's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.61,0:28:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接骨木\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elderberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.14,0:28:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我妻子泡茶总会放这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife used to make tea with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.36,0:28:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是天然的抗流感药\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a natural flu remedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.73,0:28:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦勒病得厉害没法看病 但我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caleb's too sick to help. I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.24,0:28:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有太多次对我们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so many times we haven't been able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所发生的不幸毫无回天之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to change what was happening… what was happening to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.36,0:28:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望可以 事实却不尽如人意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wished we could, but we couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.15,0:28:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.69,0:28:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.12,0:28:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.16,0:28:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔 你进去会得病的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, if you go in there, you're gonna get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.23,0:28:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们可不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, we don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.52,0:28:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只知道这些人的病症必须得到控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we do know is that these people's symptoms need to be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔 拜托 我们可以等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, please. We can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.09,0:28:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.23,0:28:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出去是在冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You step outside, you risk your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.25,0:28:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝口水是在冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take a drink of water, you risk your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今连呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nowadays you breathe,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.85,0:28:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是在冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you risk your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.08,0:29:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every moment now you don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.27,0:29:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能选的只有为什么而冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing you can choose is what you're risking it for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.03,0:29:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能让这些人好转一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I can make these people feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,多撑一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hang on a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.36,0:29:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.04,0:29:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这理由足以让我冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's reason enough to risk mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.63,0:29:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.12,0:29:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.13,0:29:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.64,0:29:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.36,0:29:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.21,0:30:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给你说去哪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he tell you where he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.84,0:30:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,S医生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. S. is sick and…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.61,0:30:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.12,0:30:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能坚强面对的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll deal with it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.35,0:30:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get to get upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.39,0:32:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.12,0:32:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.19,0:32:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.65,0:32:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.76,0:33:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.89,0:33:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小菜一碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说过明天再干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We decided to do that tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.48,0:33:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不知道有没有明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if we get a tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.44,0:34:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会再去漂泊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know you weren't running off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.59,0:34:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题是 我们找不到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, that trail went cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.70,0:34:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.16,0:34:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was any different,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.22,0:34:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会陪你一起去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be right out there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我拿张CD吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you hand me one of them CDs right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.57,0:34:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人声吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.25,0:34:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Determined to survive…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.79,0:34:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.03,0:35:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab something!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.88,0:35:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.67,0:35:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're jammed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.37,0:35:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,往那边的缺口跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a run for the gaps right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.41,0:35:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩朝树林跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, you make a run for the.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.54,0:35:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要停下 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}woods and you don't stop for nothing, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.74,0:35:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.41,0:36:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.54,0:36:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ty!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ty!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.82,0:36:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.61,0:36:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来咬我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on and get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.56,0:37:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.86,0:37:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.09,0:37:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on and get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.88,0:37:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.66,0:37:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.17,0:37:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.69,0:38:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.25,0:38:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.89,0:38:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.86,0:38:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.49,0:38:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你也会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you wouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.59,0:39:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't in here already,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.93,0:39:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.23,0:39:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.35,0:39:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个敷头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep this on your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.54,0:39:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,兽医医嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veterinarian's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.39,0:40:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.28,0:40:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.41,0:40:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们却被小小的感冒打败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just get taken out by a glorified cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.26,0:40:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.63,0:40:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也别那样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.23,0:40:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说也只是口是心非\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I can do is stop saying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.58,0:40:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你可以做到更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.12,0:40:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经走了这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got this far somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.39,0:40:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can believe somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.57,0:40:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we all have jobs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.97,0:40:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.31,0:40:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那样做很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a stupid thing you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.78,0:41:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去外面冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going out there like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.21,0:41:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.72,0:41:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我们和孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you do a lot for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.54,0:41:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,付出很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.43,0:41:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你牺牲很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sacrifice a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.22,0:41:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们 你什么都愿意做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you wouldn't do for the people here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.53,0:41:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.20,0:41:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol…?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.85,0:41:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦和大卫是你杀的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill Karen and David?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.40,0:42:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
